.TH KINTSUGI-PERSONA 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-persona \- persona triggers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi persona
triggers [\-\-apply]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Propose trigger-map entries from refusal telemetry. Triggers map refusal terms
to alternative responses.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-apply\fR
Write the proposed triggers
.SH EXAMPLES
View proposed triggers:
.PP
  $ kintsugi persona triggers
.PP
Apply triggers:
.PP
  $ kintsugi persona triggers --apply
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-pack (1)
